; Each (test ...) stanza must name its modules explicitly.
;
; Without it, `dune runtest tests/gate/state_filter.exe` -- the addressable
; form, and the one scripts/dev-fast-test uses to run a single suite --
; fails before compiling:
;
;   Error: Module State_filter is used in several stanzas.
;
; `dune build @runtest` does not surface this, which is why it went
; unnoticed: the alias-level target builds the whole directory at once and
; never asks for one stanza by name. A binary that can only be run by
; running everything with it is a binary nobody can run alone.

(test
 (name state_filter)
 (modules state_filter)
 (libraries mathcoding_core mathcoding_attestations alcotest))

(test
 (name waiver_aggregation)
 (modules waiver_aggregation)
 (libraries mathcoding_core alcotest))
